{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12654","headline":"系乐府十二首 寿翁兴 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 寿翁兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"借问多寿翁，何方自修育。\n惟云顺所然，忘情学草木。\n始知世上术，劳苦化金玉。\n不见充所求，空闻肆耽欲。\n清和存王母，潜濩无乱黩。\n谁正好长生，此言堪佩服。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}